    ("Where should the sentence 'This radical redistribution of political power, known as ostracism, served as an institutional bulwark against authoritarian tyranny' be placed? \n[1] Classical Athenian democracy developed unique legal mechanisms to preserve civic equilibrium. [2] Once a year, citizens gathered in the agora to scratch the name of any overly dominant politician onto broken pottery shards. [3] Any public figure who received a plurality of votes was immediately cast into exile from Attica for ten years. [4] By neutralizing potential despots preemptively, the polis protected its fragile constitutional stability.", "After sentence 3", "After sentence 1", "After sentence 2", "After sentence 4", "制度總結命名功能句分析：待插入句指出「這種激進的政治權力再分配——被稱為陶片放逐制——充當了防禦專制暴政的制度性堡壘」。句 2 描述在陶片上刻上強權政客的名字，句 3 描述得票最多者即刻被放逐流放雅典十年；待插入句對這套放逐投票體制作出概念命名 (known as ostracism) 與制度定性；句 4 緊接著說 By neutralizing despots preemptively, the polis protected...。故最佳位置在句 3 之後！", "概念定性銜接：接在放逐十年的完整程序描述 (句3) 之後，引出防禦暴政的結論 (句4)，選 After sentence 3。", "最佳銜接位選 After sentence 3。", "ostracism", "/ˈɑː.strə.sɪz.əm/", "陶片放逐法排斥放逐", "bulwark", "/ˈbʊl.wɚk/", "堡壘防禦保障堡障")
